- `crates/vox-cli`: Add `benchmark_telemetry.rs` and update `commands/mens/pipeline.rs` to support new telemetry features. Add `commands/ci/eval_matrix.rs` and `commands/mens/populi/train_arm.rs`.
- `crates/vox-db`: Add `syntax_k_telemetry.rs` for storing syntax-k events.
- `docs`: Add new documentation for `syntax-k-complexity.md` and `qwen35-multimodal-phase2-backlog.md`. Update `mens-training.md` and `how-to-train-mens-4080.md`.
- `mens/runs`: Add numerous new `qwen35_qlora_smoke` and `qwen35_qlora_smoke35` related files, including `checkpoint_state.json`, `training_manifest.json`, `eval_results.json`, and `training-preflight.json`.
- `scripts`: Add `gates.yaml` and update `dogfood_qlora_cuda.ps1`.

